have our platoon leader,

01:02:52.242 --> 01:02:54.837
we'd be lined up in front of the door

01:02:54.837 --> 01:02:56.319
of our assigned cadets.

01:02:56.319 --> 01:02:58.222
And then she'd like,
whisper and count to three.

01:02:58.222 --> 01:02:59.133
And then on three,

01:02:59.133 --> 01:03:01.097
you all have to like smash
the door and get open.

01:03:01.097 --> 01:03:01.930
And then just go ahead.

01:03:01.930 --> 01:03:03.817
- You basically like fucking
Kool-Aid man, actually.

01:03:03.817 --> 01:03:05.129
- Essentially, yeah, that's
essentially what I did.

01:03:05.129 --> 01:03:08.127
And I made a few people
cry at that, so I'd like-

01:03:08.127 --> 01:03:10.287
(all laughing)

01:03:10.287 --> 01:03:11.120
- Yeah, I fucked them up.

01:03:11.120 --> 01:03:13.813
