of honor that wear there?

01:03:13.813 --> 01:03:17.248
Because like, it's so unexpected
when you first meet me.

01:03:17.248 --> 01:03:18.837
- Achievement unlocked, cause trauma.

01:03:18.837 --> 01:03:22.045
