medals or achievement.

01:03:23.628 --> 01:03:26.890
How many have you made cry,
how many kids you made cry?

01:03:26.890 --> 01:03:28.345
- So, no, I don't know.

01:03:28.345 --> 01:03:29.585
It was a learning experience.

01:03:29.585 --> 01:03:32.229
And again, it's not for
everyone, but once you're done,

01:03:32.229 --> 01:03:34.124
